# The image build context. `protocol/` (the build script compiles its .proto
# files) and `third_party/` (a path dependency) must stay in it, and so must
# every crate's tests/ directory: each manifest declares a `suite` test target,
# and cargo refuses a workspace whose declared target file is missing.
target/
.git/
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
